{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48940","headline":"山中 · 方干","name":"山中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱山却把图书卖，嗜酒空教僮仆赊。\n秪向堦前便渔钓，那知枕上有云霞。\n暗泉出石飞仍咽，小径通桥直复斜。\n窗竹未抽今夏笋，庭梅曾试当年花。\n姓名未及陶弘景，髭鬓白於姜子牙。\n松月水烟千古在，未知终久属谁家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}